    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Two hospitals in Kilifi County have received several benefits from the  Pregnancy Care Integrating Translational Science Everywhere (PRECISE)  project. This includes medical equipment, hospital infrastructure and capacity building of healthcare workers.",
